{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41687","headline":"剑池 · 陈陶","name":"剑池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦帝南巡厌火精，苍黄埋剑故丰城。\n霸图缭戾金龙螫，坤道扶摇紫气生。\n星斗卧来闲窟穴，雌雄飞去变澄泓。\n永怀惆怅中宵作，不见春雷发匣声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}